# Ode to Joy — theme from the finale of Beethoven's Symphony No. 9 (public domain),
# simplified for beginners. Transcription and bass by the Piano Practice
# contributors, released CC0.
title: Ode to Joy
composer: Ludwig van Beethoven
arranger: Piano Practice contributors
time: 4/4
key: 0
tempo: 100
license: CC0-1.0
---
RH: e4/4 e4 f4 g4 | g4 f4 e4 d4 | c4 c4 d4 e4 | e4/4. d4/8 d4/2 |
LH: c3/1          | g2/1        | c3/1        | c3/2 g2         |

RH: e4/4 e4 f4 g4 | g4 f4 e4 d4 | c4 c4 d4 e4 | d4/4. c4/8 c4/2 |
LH: c3/1          | g2/1        | c3/1        | g2/2 c3         |

RH: d4/4 d4 e4 c4 | d4/4 e4/8 f4 e4/4 c4 | d4/4 e4/8 f4 e4/4 d4 | c4/4 d4 g3/2 |
LH: g2/2 c3       | g2/4 c3/2.           | g2/4 c3/2 g2/4       | c3/4 g2/2.    |

RH: e4/4 e4 f4 g4 | g4 f4 e4 d4 | c4 c4 d4 e4 | d4/4. c4/8 c4/2 |
LH: c3/1          | g2/1        | c3/1        | g2/2 c3         |
